        <mxCell id="summary" value="PATTERN A SUMMARY: ELT warehouse-centric. Raw Parquet from S3 loaded into Snowflake Bronze via external stage + COPY INTO. All transformation in Snowflake via dbt Core: staging models (views) union Yellow and Green, reconcile schemas, apply cleaning. Mart models (tables) join zones, derive metrics, produce year-over-year aggregations. Orchestration is a single re-runnable Python script. Fewest moving parts, all logic in SQL, every transformation tested by dbt." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;fontColor=#444444;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
